      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Background plate, then the new character\n\n1. SAM masks the reference person. FILL BACKGROUND repaints only that hole, so the photo becomes an empty scene.\n2. NEW CHARACTER is a separate generation in the reference pose. The pose skeleton is the only thing taken from the photo.\n3. SAM masks that new character.\n4. STITCH places the new character on the cleaned background.\n\nMASK OUT REFERENCE should cover the whole old person. FOREGROUND EDGE should cover only the new person. If the old body still peeks out, raise the first number on MASK OUT REFERENCE."
      ]
    },
